{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "afc5e197-d884-8390-ba0d-50497c2743ed",
  "created_at": "2026-02-12T08:46:06-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Tariq Nguyen",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T08:44:55-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. Good morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T08:44:58-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning. I am calling about a pothole. The cold patch from last week, it washed out already."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T08:45:04-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, okay. So a spot that was patched last week has come apart. Where is it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T08:45:10-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is at 88 Harrison Avenue, on the Fort Adams side. Right in front of the house, and it is right in the bike lane."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T08:45:18-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Eighty-eight Harrison Avenue, in the bike lane. Got it. Is the hole open again, or just loose gravel?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T08:45:24-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The hole is open again. Gravel is all over the lane. [pause] Excuse me, can you hear me? I am on speakerphone."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T08:45:31-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you fine. I'll put in a request to have it looked at again."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T08:45:36-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. How long do repairs usually take, to come back to a spot like this?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T08:45:41-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It depends on the crew's list and the weather. Cold patch is a quick job once they get there, but it's been a rough stretch for roads, so it could be several days."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T08:45:51-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand. Okay. You have a very calm voice, by the way. It is nice."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T08:45:56-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, thank you. Do you want me to keep your number, 401-555-0199, on the request?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T08:46:01-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that is correct. Thank you, goodbye."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T08:46:04-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Bye now."
    }
  ],
